{"id":"vod_sn_37104","vodId":"37104","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"青春CUP","name_cn":"青春CUP","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/662805e4c6fcf93de36dec6ae8c13e95.jpg"},"summary":"叶山由奈（茅原实里 配音）是一个扎着双马尾的眼镜娘，外表可爱的她却有着一个令人匪夷所思的秘密——对青春期少女的内衣格外的执着，一旦发现有人穿了不合时宜的内衣，无论如何都控制不住的想要去提醒对方。就因为这样的执着，在学校中流传着许多关于由奈的流言蜚语。　　为了证实这些流言，运动健将神宫寺弥子（寿美菜子 配音）伙同同班同学白石遥（矢作纱友里 配音）偷偷的观察由奈的一举一动，却在一次意外中被由奈看到了内衣的款式。通过和由奈的深交，弥子和遥逐渐领悟到了正确穿着内衣对于女孩的重大意义。在老师水野环（大原沙耶香 配音）的帮助下，一个叫做“内衣部”的同好会应运而生。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kt3bJHH0kZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Tf2fd8sh31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uqQdKyfZaF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0tZ76Pzt3C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/esy89d33kg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rBPUzNdaVe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PFrsSNtzu01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AHGT3huHuK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9aahZKHs1q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hrq2d1VypL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2jytMaZEaL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BMcXu2KkGk1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:14.920Z"}